  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup vegetable shortening",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup cold water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wZASoLIAuiRxYA2fRM-9uusMaoI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-12492-pie-crust-iv-VAT-step-01-a06c86b680974ddfb66baad0574c72b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12492/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and salt in a medium bowl. Add shortening and mix with a fork or pastry blender until the mixture is very crumbly. Sprinkle in cold water, 1 tablespoon at a time, stirring lightly with a fork until dough holds together. You may not need all the water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oYxOVstMzJmt0laxI66b_vHvh3c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-12492-pie-crust-iv-VAT-step-02-511f419e9d7643559c401b5995e15541.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12492/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough gently on a floured pastry cloth to about 1 inch larger than your pie plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lrRZ8u_0YA8WJ7auCWijZDhID5Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-12492-pie-crust-iv-VAT-step-03-e732e08cc7e4458da75420f7e0d1f2fd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12492/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold dough carefully in half, place it in pie plate, and unfold. Press gently into pan. For a single-crust pie, trim to about ½ inch beyond the rim, fold under, and flute or crimp as desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MovtKZmFn9Ea5mL8Ih0JtrXbm0g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-12492-pie-crust-iv-VAT-step-04-2-56a2d27d306a40bba3d90ee3a22c8adc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12492/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pUXeAt-yuZMPzDpih7ksfhMDpnw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-12492-pie-crust-iv-VAT-4x3-283f538266534cab8e0ce2f7b496ce5c.jpg"
